{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12902","headline":"送王府张参军附学及第东归 · 韩翃","name":"送王府张参军附学及第东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邻家不识鬬鸡翁，闭户能齐隐者风。\n顾步曾爲小山客，成名因事大江公。\n一身千里寒芜上，单马重裘腊月中。\n寂寂故园行见在，暮天残雪洛城东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}